      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Haha, is there such thing as a 'necessary' crash?\n\nTo have a better chance of being actioned, try to report more information on particular crashes, if possible. The information that it only started to crash with the latest version is useful, but more can be given. For example, what did you/someone-else do that appeared to cause the crash? What was the nature of the crash? Was it a freeze or a CTD?\n\nTry to upload the logs after a crash. They often contain invaluable information.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
